# Living backend notes

Follow `backend-learning-reference` **only when the user explicitly asked**
to use the mentor skill or to capture backend notes.

When they did:

1. Update `docs/BACKEND-REFERENCE.md` in the same turn as the explanation.
2. Also update `~/.cursor/skills/backend-learning-reference/BACKEND-REFERENCE.md`.

Do not duplicate `docs/LEARNING.md` or `CHANGELOG.md`. Do not create these notebooks
in other repos.
